                    Gives You Today : Simple Page V 1.5
============================================================================
 
      A Simple Pager For The Ami-Express BBS Sytems V 2.xx and 3.xx
                  It Should Work Fine On S-Express Too...
 
To Install It Copy The Files SPage.Rexx And Spage.Doc Into The Directory
 
Doors:SPage/ ... For /X 3.xx Copy The File O.Info Into Your BBS.CMD Dir...
                 For /X 2.xx Add This To Your BBS.CMD File...
 
 
-- cut --
*O        RM010Doors:Spage/Spage.Rexx
-- cut --
  
 
In this version you need to do a little bit of configuration...
In the .Rexx file you'll see a line
 

-- cut --
Okre = 200
-- cut --
 
 
Change the value of okre to your override chat level... I've found
no way yet to retrieve this from /X so you'll have to do it.. Sorry
for this inconveniance..
(Fans of 'Reginald' aka 'Geert Hoste' will recognize this "yell" from his
song "Heyenoeist!" (om effe hallo aan de vlamingen te zeggen !)
 
Oki That's It.. Quick Hy's To My Bud's EveryWhere...
 
